{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_021jun_01_1_2_021_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:24b2aa7714318005f122de9449fc7d434f13611279dc460287c99aedd7540992",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_01_1_2_021_01:1_2_021_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd550a329bef82583dbb3ecf7c2a52b369b7ad0eb030a0d5871d10b325606678",
      "text": "寄托给重要之人的思念",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_01_1_2_021_01:1_2_021_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4375398de2f21b58def2cbdfdc2f0847dde71c52baf3502fa2a7a82c460c79c",
      "text": "某天，制作人偶然撞见了正凝视着百货商店\n橱窗的旬。\n向一脸苦恼的他搭话后，\n才得知他正在挑选送给一直承蒙关照之人的礼物。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_01_1_2_021_01:1_2_021_01_a:cmd-000011:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_01_1_2_021_01:1_2_021_01_a:cmd-000011:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd550a329bef82583dbb3ecf7c2a52b369b7ad0eb030a0d5871d10b325606678",
      "text": "寄托给重要之人的思念",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_01_1_2_021_01:1_2_021_01_a:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:88ad0abdbdeb2ae4219d4bc196b7ad1fa5dbc6ef0015c2148d34db921e130a1c",
      "text": "（今天的工作结束了，\n买点东西再回去吧……咦？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_01_1_2_021_01:1_2_021_01_a:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:395e1e0587dd4b9f9651c99d8688715f896c700b3636d0c7194d15a0e800904d",
      "text": "…………",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_01_1_2_021_01:1_2_021_01_a:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a97dde3953bad493a106ce88a59ad206a03efede1c73e7330c9d69fa688ea724",
      "text": "（那是……旬先生？他看展示柜看得好专注啊……\n上去打个招呼吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_01_1_2_021_01:1_2_021_01_a:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b8780e6623fd1b4ec6cc3218ca44c2d2965f34e5e981465c3f44b9f6c6fd53a4",
      "text": "您好，旬先生。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_01_1_2_021_01:1_2_021_01_a:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c1f3b614290200ddd9e544787d261ec91ccf1baa52f00669aea8276ec99e16a3",
      "text": "啊，●●●●プロデューサー。\n您好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_01_1_2_021_01:1_2_021_01_a:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a38108c65182248afdfad3e49d43a2b97181a613a2697823657c71df56fd2a8c",
      "text": "没想到会在这种地方遇见您，真少见呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_01_1_2_021_01:1_2_021_01_a:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5f2d3a6e3951970c5e9ff76ba8d0e43f33a56e1157b99ad21ca1a2601ec0c16",
      "text": "我刚才在附近工作。\n旬先生是在买东西吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_01_1_2_021_01:1_2_021_01_a:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c",
      "text": "哎？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_01_1_2_021_01:1_2_021_01_a:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cee77b9dc481e31be16b700ac3c4b8915fd67ba6e8ae43165c24c85058c4b64f",
      "text": "因为看到您一直盯着橱窗看，\n我想是不是在找什么东西呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_01_1_2_021_01:1_2_021_01_a:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7053001c840b6997007e286fd82ea0df1a241226415c5bd3087a92c41545222",
      "text": "啊，被您看到了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_01_1_2_021_01:1_2_021_01_a:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea630243b166db9ed9d794104a64988fe5a5e0664bc508ecc10da5919fe66b9e",
      "text": "其实……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_01_1_2_021_01:1_2_021_01_b:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d281df22d5cfba2e84786698ce82d35123e1fd83f18db99d109e269f85f2b50f",
      "text": "我家里有一位叫榊女士的帮佣。\n虽然按辈分是夏来的祖母……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_01_1_2_021_01:1_2_021_01_b:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd7a56f4d893548bb3cd6f556ca25685abfc5915aabc0adfee4fa45634ed6f09",
      "text": "但对于很早就失去母亲的我来说，\n榊女士就像养母一样的存在。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_01_1_2_021_01:1_2_021_01_b:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2199f9cb92a694986628b3bd49adda913860a1b31efbd77a3af5a2cbd5106e45",
      "text": "所以……为了答谢平日里受到的照顾，\n我正在挑礼物。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_01_1_2_021_01:1_2_021_01_b:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f210d32dc236d35472b6400f1ce67e868616c528c90382ce20b5d70a924a8371",
      "text": "原来是这样，所以才一直在看橱窗啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_01_1_2_021_01:1_2_021_01_b:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fae1abf6f1285674fffc7beff12aad7982d7cadcd62ece361a908df2ef7684e9",
      "text": "是的。不过，我很少有这种经验，\n觉得实在很难选……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_01_1_2_021_01:1_2_021_01_b:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:71d80fa34e0a34c6336c9ac0b94f58b99890dcc0d3ade2d862cb41f61543187f",
      "text": "原来如此……有了。如果旬先生不介意的话，\n能让我帮个忙吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_01_1_2_021_01:1_2_021_01_b:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6217328d0e1e6b239b72d65a3e33e04968d5190190f6b700def0092faf2ffcce",
      "text": "两个人一边商量一边挑选，说不定能找到好礼物呢。\n您觉得怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_01_1_2_021_01:1_2_021_01_b:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ae12a10453213883e6b6e1325bb2f944af1e29cf151c990e09c210ca5cb6f74d",
      "text": "商量，吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_01_1_2_021_01:1_2_021_01_b:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:37967b4b390330f1dc31fd63f4d580e7f7b4ddf5d4182283bec0c4311a7c54e3",
      "text": "……也是呢。要是●●●●プロデューサー时间方便的话，\n就拜托您了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_01_1_2_021_01:1_2_021_01_b:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:019cada9a48146b8f0632f032b6822b8cf8a0a7a63724654c37057bc3f5a4616",
      "text": "好的，包在我身上！\n我们一起挑选一份出色的礼物吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_01_1_2_021_01:1_2_021_01_c:cmd-000011:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c70197100b1ba0c498f0a9313b743a83be80d5c9358f3a1185552981e137dffb",
      "text": "店内",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_01_1_2_021_01:1_2_021_01_c:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8506e02a1ef0ed55983a4f8d41502e5e5088076102e7ac0bf0a4554f192356a0",
      "text": "您有想好大概要买什么样的东西吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_01_1_2_021_01:1_2_021_01_c:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20fb2c61b5a833e2b2c276700f9b803e687ca898f001bdc521567b4311fc543e",
      "text": "这个嘛。虽然想法很笼统，\n但我觉得平时能用上的东西会比较好吧……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_01_1_2_021_01:1_2_021_01_c:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:48a1b1f851b6d86570092e4f924de3359e953de7435805102030cbd8317a0b4b",
      "text": "平时能用上的吗……\n既然这样，手帕怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_01_1_2_021_01:1_2_021_01_c:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb68111a425ddb7aaab499dfe941ad83a4eda33189bbb382cdd79678b545f78b",
      "text": "我最开始也想到了手帕。但考虑到因人而异，\n对材质可能会有各自的偏好，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_01_1_2_021_01:1_2_021_01_c:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:531912807c0c0dfdf0ddc36602985f135f417d4dff80c6f78abb84b6b5b46c40",
      "text": "所以这次就作罢了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_01_1_2_021_01:1_2_021_01_c:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f268ed9ea25ffb9fe0085b7fc6d4ea56cea966e01c5bee8972b441d0be3a93d8",
      "text": "这样啊……\n那么，围巾怎么样呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_01_1_2_021_01:1_2_021_01_c:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6b6b9ce2efdf38b84f0a97df48d08765bf76fee21cfc8463cbb78b11fcb0c0a5",
      "text": "可是，听说前些天刚买了新的。\n我是听夏来说的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_01_1_2_021_01:1_2_021_01_c:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:50b9513cdb0feca891e2fc0bd45be8f7685ab59703b7c125631be5066e53eae3",
      "text": "其他像是围裙和帽子我也考虑了很多，\n但总觉得哪一个都不太合适。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_01_1_2_021_01:1_2_021_01_c:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d5640423eb36a85bdf6e31ecf481d28d50c1c50d4bd3cde89abacc8572ed316",
      "text": "该怎么办才好呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_01_1_2_021_01:1_2_021_01_c:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d4ac1ee0cb693f1ef60b2f103da51950308f40f32fa184f05041187f11c21497",
      "text": "让我想想……\n那么，那个怎么样呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_01_1_2_021_01:1_2_021_01_d:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4066b2f085bc328f89d379642bb27d524bb7cdfcb947893242f447377fa95bba",
      "text": "手套，吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_01_1_2_021_01:1_2_021_01_d:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0cfdd37630e19ffe114ecec9957f5e7a73fa82dc3da3865d1a8e1a68bb58627",
      "text": "或许也是您已经排除的备选方案。不过，\n这个时期备有多几副也是很合适的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_01_1_2_021_01:1_2_021_01_d:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c58503597bb0cb855375d1ab3c69c76e090211f84ce0c416935e297298482e93",
      "text": "原来如此，确实。最近天气也一直很冷，\n说不定是个好选择。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_01_1_2_021_01:1_2_021_01_d:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd60381fa5bbdf47d30973ea0bb8442b16ab003c98a38364bf121cd8fb5d8490",
      "text": "您还记得榊女士现在戴的手套是什么款式和颜色吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_01_1_2_021_01:1_2_021_01_d:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56ddf61a8ebc51b595a14cc35198a7fb2e97d6aebe07380e77e96335c090e453",
      "text": "让我想想，要是不跟现在用的一样的话，\n这一类如何呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_01_1_2_021_01:1_2_021_01_d:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d3c0d830f39cb4cd0bf78eadd0a318aa03937c79b7c1346f4270a205b4986bf",
      "text": "……这个设计，榊女士应该会喜欢。\n听说保暖性也很高。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_01_1_2_021_01:1_2_021_01_d:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ef21271aa3259ba8d625279258270323445f94fd9ecc5b01168f5b7250f5d6c",
      "text": "摸起来手感也非常好呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_01_1_2_021_01:1_2_021_01_d:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3020d3d9f9560f184e50e2682c29e3f774f5d0d9ac9a4ed37036caad24cbffb4",
      "text": "决定了。\n就选这个吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_01_1_2_021_01:1_2_021_01_d:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:915938f0358cdd3756546749b1ffac5604e8d283ee4bf4262f58472117cfce40",
      "text": "感觉非常棒呢！\n礼物能顺利定下来真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_01_1_2_021_01:1_2_021_01_d:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d93308021405440c145e84fbde91da5ca63181d50051e75a85ca905c69d3162b",
      "text": "是的。\n那我这就去结账了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_01_1_2_021_01:1_2_021_01_e:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:42db266b199ee2af29257470d18ec6d1e8d162c71907be7628847a2d2a9ecdd7",
      "text": "那个，●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_01_1_2_021_01:1_2_021_01_e:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa453af692159ebf93d7a42e12f5040efc5f1524b23b7a46c2cfaf0f6934a377",
      "text": "今天多亏有您陪我，帮了大忙。\n能偶遇到您真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_01_1_2_021_01:1_2_021_01_e:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75475c4f7d908129c97e1200bd8163b98910880c461768b322b8da11e7d5d4e1",
      "text": "正如●●●●プロデューサー所说，\n有人听自己倾诉，脑子里的思路就会清晰很多呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_01_1_2_021_01:1_2_021_01_e:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d0b8e97148be5f1ef00576ee48c71e0393f5915718e13681381cd27c7178c37",
      "text": "光靠我一个人，可能就决定不下来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_01_1_2_021_01:1_2_021_01_e:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f9c87ba3d5f9b0b318905486444b9795c9fb180fc20c3ddfe3c14e9ea45ec45",
      "text": "所以……非常感谢您。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_01_1_2_021_01:1_2_021_01_e:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b6edd8d4127b7683499da3e39293a5f552dd3f1e00032669473d988f6740d359",
      "text": "哪里的话，能帮上忙我也很高兴！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_01_1_2_021_01:1_2_021_01_e:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:67835614f22dae489945796c2c247cc4675f5c230d5c2bc2ab38a2b9d5913114",
      "text": "虽然说不上是今天的谢礼，\n不过往后如果您需要人手，请随时叫我。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_01_1_2_021_01:1_2_021_01_e:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac3ca26793c890e9e3be7f2d44d1e1086f383331be02d26bd141b523922aa121",
      "text": "虽然我觉得自己可能帮不上太多的忙就是了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_01_1_2_021_01:1_2_021_01_e:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dee27179a54b2716ced87ca018411e0b7bdce0d40a950528f4b8143dc16f6bb2",
      "text": "没那回事！\n到时一定会去拜托您的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
